%，創三年新高"},{"title":"Airbnb’s Q3 Revenue Growth Reaches Three-Year High as It Lifts Full-Year Guidance and Unveils New $12 Billion Buyback!","src":"www.tmgm.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxNYzVrQ2YwdVhydjQ3U0swXzhHd0tUQmJ6Z1NsN05NZFlrenpxdTBfTUJ4eVA5RkQydXRTaS15bXgxWEh2VEp0cmhPN0hDY0xOeUZBOFk5LUV1Ykt3cHVhNldDeEpYQi1maGpic042UUpSeFFjNldRQ2R0TmNOTXBRR2ltX09odGpT?oc=5","date":"2026-11-06","zh":"Airbnb 上調全年指引並推出新的 120 億美元回購計劃，第三季營收成長創三年新高！"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":4},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":2},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":2},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-12","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1559720/000155972026000004/abnb-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Airbnb was founded in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown into a global community of over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2.5 billion guest arrivals in almost every country and region across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays, experiences, and services that enable guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way. We operate a global marketplace connecting guests with stays, experiences, and services, collectively in over 220 countries and regions. Our offerings have expanded to include services and redesigned experiences, which launched in May 2025.","zh":"Airbnb 成立於 2007 年，當時兩位房東在舊金山的家中迎接了三位房客，此後已發展成為擁有超過 500 萬房東的全球社區，幾乎在全球每個國家和地區接待了超過 25 億房客。房東每天都會提供獨特的住宿、體驗和服務，讓房客能夠以更真實的方式與社區建立聯繫。我們經營一個全球市場，為 220 多個國家和地區的賓客提供住宿、體驗和服務。我們的產品已擴展到包括服務和重新設計的體驗，並於 2025 年 5 月推出。"},{"en":"We operate with five key stakeholders in mind: our employees, shareholders, hosts, guests, and the communities we serve. Our commitment to making long-term decisions that benefit all these stakeholders is fundamental to our sustained success.","zh":"我們在營運時考慮到五個主要利害關係人：我們的員工、股東、東道主、賓客和我們服務的社區。我們致力於做出有利於所有利害關係人的長期決策，這是我們持續成功的基礎。"},{"en":"Our key strategic priorities include making our service better, bringing Airbnb to more parts of the world, and expanding what we offer. Over the past several years, we have introduced hundreds of new features and upgrades to our platform spanning nearly every part of our service from pricing to quality to customer support. Additionally, we are leveraging our global markets strategy, which includes a more localized approach to product updates and marketing to raise awareness and consideration in less mature markets. We are also extending our platform beyond stays with new offerings, such as Airbnb Services and redesigned experiences, with plans to continue to expand our business beyond travel accommodations using our multi-year product roadmap to help drive long-term growth.","zh":"我們的關鍵策略重點包括改善我們的服務、將 Airbnb 帶到世界更多地區以及擴大我們的服務範圍。在過去的幾年裡，我們為我們的平台引入了數百個新功能和升級，幾乎涵蓋了我們服務的每個部分，從價格到品質到客戶支援。此外，我們正在利用我們的全球市場策略，其中包括更在地化的產品更新和行銷方法，以提高欠成熟市場的認知度和考慮度。我們還透過 Airbnb 服務和重新設計的體驗等新產品將我們的平台擴展到住宿之外，並計劃利用我們的多年產品路線圖繼續將我們的業務擴展到旅行住宿之外，以幫助推動長期成長。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Non Us","val":7427000000,"zh":"非我們"},{"name":"North America","val":5196000000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"US","val":4814000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"EMEA","val":4729000000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Latin America","val":1160000000,"zh":"拉丁美洲"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":1156000000,"zh":"亞太"}],"total":12241000000}},"peers":["DASH","SNOW","ZM","UBER","SHOP"]}}